1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:02,559
(Howard:)she made some great points.

2
00:00:02,725 --> 00:00:05,725
(Howard:)You and I have known each other
a long time,

3
00:00:05,895 --> 00:00:08,735
(Howard:)and I didn't hear the rest
'cause she took her bra off.

4
00:00:12,902 --> 00:00:14,442
(Sheldon:)Very well.

5
00:00:14,604 --> 00:00:17,104
(Sheldon:)How do you propose
we move forward?

6
00:00:17,273 --> 00:00:21,053
(Howard:)For starters, we could stop
insulting each other.

7
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,780
(Sheldon:)That's a great idea.

8
00:00:22,945 --> 00:00:24,615
(Sheldon:)And in the spirit
of our new arrangement,

9
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,560
(Sheldon:)I will mask my surprise
that you came up with it.

10
00:00:33,022 --> 00:00:35,472
(Howard:)Anyway, I got invited
to do a little talk at NASA

11
00:00:35,625 --> 00:00:37,195
(Howard:)in Houston this weekend.

12
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,810
(Howard:)They gave me two tickets.
Bernadette can't go.

13
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:42,302
(Howard:)You want to come with me?
You can visit your mom,

14
00:00:42,465 --> 00:00:44,745
(Howard:)and I'll show you
around the space center.

15
00:00:46,269 --> 00:00:47,649
(Sheldon:)I have one question.

16
00:00:48,604 --> 00:00:51,714
(Sheldon:)Is this a prank
where we land in Houston

17
00:00:51,874 --> 00:00:53,474
(Sheldon:)and you've made up
wanted posters

18
00:00:53,643 --> 00:00:56,423
(Sheldon:)that have my face with
a mustache and a Spanish name

19
00:00:56,579 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)and then I get arrested
and deported to South America?

